    /// <c>X</c> in namespace <c>A.B</c>; generic arity is appended as <c>`N</c> so <c>Foo</c> and
    /// <c>Foo&lt;T&gt;</c> differ.
    /// Roslyn compares hint names case-insensitively, so types whose names differ only in case
